     1,
     "<span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><font color=\"#000000\">Hi</font></span></span><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><font color=\"#000000\">I am currently trying to analyse some GT3x raw Actigraph data that was downloaded from devices in 2020 and keep running into an error message which I don&#39;t know how to fix. Does anyone know what I need to do to fix this error and analyse the file? </font></span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><font color=\"#000000\">The error message is: </font></span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"> Negative samples estimated, dates are wrong in info, using maximum samples (100 days)\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in g.dotorcomma(datafile, dformat, mon, rmc.dec = params_rawdata[[&quot;rmc.dec&quot;]]) : \r\n  Problem with reading .gt3x file in GGIR function dotorcomma</span></span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><font color=\"#000000\">Thanks</font></span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><font color=\"#000000\">Naomi </font></span></span></div>"
